in_scope_clauses.summary:
Label content — supplier name + address + phone; nominal
quantity (general public); product identifier; UFI (mixtures
classified for health/physical hazards); hazard pictograms;
signal word (Danger or Warning); hazard statements (H + EUH);
precautionary statements (P, max ~6); supplementary
information.

Quality Assurance Programme — independent of study conduct;
study-based, facility-based, process-based inspections;
audit reports to Test Facility Management + Study Director;
verification of Final Report against raw data; QA Statement
in Final Report per Principle 9.1(j).
